I had been thinking of a few new ideas that could be added to this game to make
it more interesting.

1) Allow vampires to turn into bats and/or wolves, use that creatures abilities
   (speed, flight, good nose, echo location, etc.) to rapidly close in upon the
   player. If the player angered the vampire without killing him, allow the 
   vampire to change to a wolf and hunt the player by smell.

2) Three bites from a vampire and you either get sick, or maybe randomly change
   into a bat.

3) Eyeglasses that allow the player to penetrate illusion and/or see the unseen
   or hidden traps.

4) dancing shoes (usually cursed, of course) that cause an effect similar to
   being stunned (not walking/attacking where you want to). But, if blessed
   and enchanted above, say, +1, they add 1 to dexterity and affect the 
   player like a speed potion.


Does anyone else have any ideas or comments?


